   {:negative-cases
    "Unavailable family/mode/provider, hidden allocation in constrained/core contexts, implicit narrowing/truncation/overflow/precision or rounding/NaN-policy loss, ambiguous branch/unit conversion and symbolic equality without valid evidence. Keep independent source conflicts on particular conversion modes open rather than choosing an undocumented policy.",
    :criterion-id "profile-gap/math/numeric-profile-eligibility",
    :acceptance-text
    "Criterion profile-gap/math/numeric-profile-eligibility (Open): Input: Numeric family/mode/conversion/provider request with active profile/target, allocation support, precision/rounding/NaN/branch/unit and proof facts. Accept: Emit and check the concrete profile support matrix for fixed/arbitrary integers, rationals, proof reals, floats, complex, intervals, symbolic and enabled units. Keep numeric families explicit in types/EFIR/runtime artifacts; admit explicit exact/checked/rounded/saturating/wrapping/proof/unsafe conversion classes only under their actual declared legality; preserve domain/codomain/precision/branch/source annotations. Symbolic equality requires proof rather than tree shape. Reject: Unavailable family/mode/provider, hidden allocation in constrained/core contexts, implicit narrowing/truncation/overflow/precision or rounding/NaN-policy loss, ambiguous branch/unit conversion and symbolic equality without valid evidence. Keep independent source conflicts on particular conversion modes open rather than choosing an undocumented policy. Required outputs: Numeric-kind lattice, conversion-rule table, machine-readable support matrix/mode/provider records, EFIR annotations and conformance cases for every supported conversion/family; MATH1-FAMILY/CONVERSION/NARROW/PRECISION/ROUNDING/BRANCH/ALLOCATION/EQUALITY/PROFILE diagnostics with span/family/mode/profile/target/provider/proof. Dependencies: types/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/types2-check-declared-abstractions, legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks, lower/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/lower1-validate-lowering-inputs interface facts, not whole-task completion. Exact source predicates and frozen evidence: specs/requirement-reconciliation/profile-system/gap-completion.edn, mapping math/numeric-profile-eligibility; all attached contextual and negative predicates remain required. No implementation acceptance is inferred.",
